{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CannaBiz: Weed Shop Owner \u2013 the ultimate cannabis business simulation where you build, manage, and expand your very own weed shop empire in the heart of Amsterdam! \ud83c\udf0d\ud83d\udc9a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the vibrant world of legalised cannabis culture and take on the role of an ambitious entrepreneur determined to dominate the green scene. Whether you're a strategic tycoon or a chill shopkeeper, <strong>CannaBiz: Weed Shop Owner</strong> offers a high-stakes blend of business management, customisation, and lifestyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f Start Small, Grow Big \u2013 Open a humble shop, stock up on premium strains, edibles, and accessories, and build your reputation in the booming cannabis industry.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/d315374d1854c04ab9f348edb72f67c2.poster.avif?t=1772027291\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/d315374d1854c04ab9f348edb72f67c2.webm?t=1772027291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/d315374d1854c04ab9f348edb72f67c2.mp4?t=1772027291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Customise Your Store \u2013 Arrange shelves, decorate with neon signs and chill furniture, and create the perfect atmosphere for your customers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/8996971a90c720808372260dbcc71ffe.poster.avif?t=1772027291\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/8996971a90c720808372260dbcc71ffe.webm?t=1772027291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/8996971a90c720808372260dbcc71ffe.mp4?t=1772027291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Hire &amp; Manage Staff \u2013 Bring in employees to handle sales, keep the shop clean, and provide security. Train your team to maximise efficiency and profits!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/c35be6ebafc083cf73b65ed591303968.poster.avif?t=1772027291\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/c35be6ebafc083cf73b65ed591303968.webm?t=1772027291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/c35be6ebafc083cf73b65ed591303968.mp4?t=1772027291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeac Experience the Lifestyle \u2013 Take a break and enjoy your own products\u2014but be careful, getting too high on the job might make things\u2026 hazy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/adb4f852f4402948b7cb21b55716b785.poster.avif?t=1772027291\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/adb4f852f4402948b7cb21b55716b785.webm?t=1772027291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/adb4f852f4402948b7cb21b55716b785.mp4?t=1772027291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Expand Across the City \u2013 Open new locations, and cater to a growing customer base. Unlock new products and new locations in the city.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/1faaf4f551d442e17cc51e4c58be701d.poster.avif?t=1772027291\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/1faaf4f551d442e17cc51e4c58be701d.webm?t=1772027291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/1faaf4f551d442e17cc51e4c58be701d.mp4?t=1772027291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 Build Your Empire \u2013 Set your prices, manage expenses, and keep up with demand to rake in the cash.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/9a915b5f969761a0be0993a3aa06c2cd.poster.avif?t=1772027291\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/9a915b5f969761a0be0993a3aa06c2cd.webm?t=1772027291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/9a915b5f969761a0be0993a3aa06c2cd.mp4?t=1772027291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>CannaBiz: Weed Shop Owner</strong>, success is in your hands. Roll up, stock up, and take your weed shop to the top! \ud83c\udf3f\ud83d\udd25</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730340?t=1772027291","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/e517800fc51992ffc07aed885fea5ae61868d1d8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772027291","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/668e6771a520a9bc9efddbb13b2cb1a79c73e29c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772027291","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/668e6771a520a9bc9efddbb13b2cb1a79c73e29c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772027291","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game is about managing a coffee shop in Amsterdam, which implies the use and representation of marijuana products."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4293980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CannaBiz: Weed Shop Owner \u2013 the ultimate cannabis business simulation where you build, manage, and expand your very own weed shop empire in the heart of Amsterdam! \ud83c\udf0d\ud83d\udc9a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the vibrant world of legalised cannabis culture and take on the role of an ambitious entrepreneur determined to dominate the green scene. Whether you're a strategic tycoon or a chill shopkeeper, <strong>CannaBiz: Weed Shop Owner</strong> offers a high-stakes blend of business management, customisation, and lifestyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f Start Small, Grow Big \u2013 Open a humble shop, stock up on premium strains, edibles, and accessories, and build your reputation in the booming cannabis industry.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730340/extras/d315374d1854c04ab9f348edb72f67c2.poster.avif?t=1772027291\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto